house. Anyone, even an unknown young architect from Denmark, could try to win. As Goosen's grand project gathered momentum, he flew back to London to be knighted by the queen. And on his return, tipped off by a journalist, customs officers asked to search his luggage. They found it to be packed with naughty photographs and even naughtier rubber masks. In 1950s Australia, it was a scandal. Sir Eugene fled back to London, a broken man. Alas, Sir Eugene's fate, great talent, self-inflicted wounds and a tragic end to a great career
院。任何人，甚至是来自丹麦的不知名年轻建筑师，都可以尝试去赢得比赛。随着古森斯的宏伟项目逐渐推进，他飞回伦敦接受女王的册封。而在他回国时，海关官员在记者的通风报信下，要求搜查他的行李。他们发现里面塞满了色情照片，甚至还有更加出格的橡胶面具。在 20 世纪 50 年代的澳大利亚，这是一桩丑闻。尤金爵士狼狈逃回伦敦，成了一个心碎的人。唉，尤金爵士的命运——伟大的才华、自作自受的创伤以及一段伟大职业生涯的悲惨结局——

